Package: hanuchi
Version: 2.0.1
Architecture: all
Maintainer: Mikhail Mlhcnn <mikhail@advnirr.org>
Section: net
Priority: optional
Homepage: https://github.com/Advnirr/hanuchi
Depends: python3, python3-gi, gir1.2-gtk-4.0, gir1.2-adw-1
Recommends: logmein-hamachi, pkexec | policykit-1
Description: Minimalist GTK4 frontend for LogMeIn Hamachi
 Shows your Hamachi networks and who is online in them, joins, creates,
 leaves and deletes networks, and starts the logmein-hamachi service
 through polkit.
 .
 Hamachi itself is not in the Debian archive: install the logmein-hamachi
 package from vpn.net first.
